<div class="dashboard-wrap"><div class="dashboard-label"><span class="live-dot"></span> A CLEARER PICTURE, IN ONE PLACE <span>CONCEPT PREVIEW</span></div><div class="dashboard"><aside class="dash-sidebar"><span class="dash-brand">v<span>Bi</span></span><span class="dash-nav selected"><Icon/> Overview</span><span class="dash-nav"><Icon name="box"/> Inventory</span><span class="dash-nav"><Icon name="chart"/> Insights</span><span class="dash-nav"><Icon name="screen"/> Machines</span><div class="dash-bottom">WORKSPACE<br/><strong>Your vending business</strong></div></aside><div class="dash-main"><div class="dash-heading"><div><small>YOUR WORKSPACE</small><h3>Operations overview</h3></div><span class="dash-period">Sample week ▾</span></div><div class="dash-metrics"><div><small>Sales visibility</small><strong>One clear view</strong><span>Across your locations</span></div><div><small>Inventory insight</small><strong>Plan ahead</strong><span>Spot replenishment needs</span></div><div><small>Fleet oversight</small><strong>Stay informed</strong><span>Focus your next action</span></div></div><div class="dash-chart"><div class="chart-title"><strong>Sales activity</strong><span>Illustrative data</span></div><div class="chart"><div class="gridlines"></div><svg viewBox="0 0 600 150" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-label="Illustrative sales activity chart" role="img"><defs><linearGradient id="chart-fill" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#16a6a1" stop-opacity=".22"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#16a6a1" stop-opacity="0"/></linearGradient></defs><path d="M0 125 50 112 100 119 150 79 200 91 250 65 300 73 350 39 400 51 450 26 500 41 550 14 600 24V150H0Z" fill="url(#chart-fill)"/><path d="M0 125 50 112 100 119 150 79 200 91 250 65 300 73 350 39 400 51 450 26 500 41 550 14 600 24" fill="none" stroke="#16a6a1" stroke-width="3"/></svg></div><div class="chart-days"><span>MON</span><span>TUE</span><span>WED</span><span>THU</span><span>FRI</span><span>SAT</span><span>SUN</span></div></div><div class="dash-table"><div><strong>Location overview</strong><span>Sample locations</span></div><div><span><i class="location-dot"></i> Business district</span><span>Inventory review</span><b>View →</b></div><div><span><i class="location-dot turquoise"></i> Workplace hub</span><span>Sales review</span><b>View →</b></div></div></div></div><p class="preview-caption">Illustrative interface only. Not a product screenshot. Layout, data and modules are examples; confirm available capabilities in your demo.</p></div>
